  "description": "BUILDERS, DEVELOPERS & INVESTORS TAKE NOTE\n\nPRIME RESIDENTIAL DEVELOPMENT OPPORTUNITY\n\nNo. 1 & 3 Davitt's Terrace, Castlebar, Co. Mayo\n\n2 no Existing 4 Bedroom Residence with Significant Development Potential\n\nGuide Price: €600,000 each \n\nPotential for 16 to 20 units subject to planning permission granted \nA rare opportunity to acquire a substantial residential property together with adjoining development lands in one of Castlebar's most established and sought-after residential locations.\n\nThe property comprises an existing 4-bedroom semi-detached bungalow together with a large adjoining yard and lands offering exceptional future development potential.\n\nThe lands are being offered for sale subject to the proposed purchaser obtaining planning permission and, in the opinion of the selling agents, may have the capacity for approximately 10 two-storey terraced houses, subject to planning permission and all necessary statutory consents.\n\nPrime town centre location. Development opportunities of this scale rarely come to the market in Castlebar.\n\nIdeal for:\n• Builders\n• Developers\n• Investors\n• Housing providers\n• Land banks for future development\n\nViewing strictly by appointment with the sole selling agents.\n\nNigel Dineen & Martin Finn Auctioneers\n086 2130723 | 094 9362216\n\nEverything we touch turns to SOLD\n\nDisclaimer:\nAny reference to development potential is subject to the purchaser obtaining all necessary planning permissions and statutory consents.",
